  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/04/GustavoParadisManaBar.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El cantante Gustavo Parad&iacute;s ha repetido actuaci&oacute;n la tarde de este domingo de Pascua en Man&aacute; Bar, en la calle 8 de Marzo de Onda, con sus versiones de los mejores temas de pop y rock de los 80 y los 90 en ac&uacute;stico.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/canta-autor-al-mana-bar/img_3711.jpg\" alt=\"img_3711\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/canta-autor-al-mana-bar/img_3712.jpg\" alt=\"img_3712\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/canta-autor-al-mana-bar/img_3713.jpg\" alt=\"img_3713\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/canta-autor-al-mana-bar/img_3714.jpg\" alt=\"img_3714\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/canta-autor-al-mana-bar/img_3716.jpg\" alt=\"img_3716\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/canta-autor-al-mana-bar/img_3717.jpg\" alt=\"img_3717\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/canta-autor-al-mana-bar/img_3719.jpg\" alt=\"img_3719\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/canta-autor-al-mana-bar/img_3721.jpg\" alt=\"img_3721\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/canta-autor-al-mana-bar/img_3722.jpg\" alt=\"img_3722\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2